Buck also discovered repository-wide Rust and dependency test targets before analysis failed. The admitted TypeScript BUCK files expose typecheck and dist targets, not TestInfo targets. Therefore `buck2 test //...` does not execute the same TypeScript surface as `buck2 build //:quick`.
